{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By progressing through the game and completing missions, you'll unlock seasonal events where special monsters appear during gathering and dungeons at certain times of the year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat these monsters to obtain unique materials, which can then be exchanged for exclusive outfits, equipment, and interior items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Monster Data Sets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Adds new missions, monsters, and materials to the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Materials from Monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special monsters that appear during gathering or dungeon exploration will drop rare materials.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bread Eggs, Large Ruby, Large Sapphire, Cactie  Seedling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exchangeable Interior Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Flower Land in Yano Market. Requires special materials.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cactie Shelf, Cactie Basket, Macram\u00e9 Cactie, Pair of Macram\u00e9 Cactie, Triple Cactie, Group-planted Cactie, Basket of Cactie, Potted Cactie, Mantel Gold Ingot, Mantel Mineral Domes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exchangeable Outfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St. Requires special materials.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Light Armor, Soft Kid's Panda, Panda Baby Suit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exchangeable Equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St. Requires special materials.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Mask, Golden Wings, Star Bread-style Backpack, Gazo Bread-style Backpack, Veras Bread Hat, River Octo Bread Hat, Shishin Bread-style Canteen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978140?t=1761802793","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978140?t=1761802793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978140/b596d63eb456b63590567922bd76187a619a135c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761802793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978140/b596d63eb456b63590567922bd76187a619a135c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761802793","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By progressing through the game and completing missions, you'll unlock seasonal events where special monsters appear during gathering and dungeons at certain times of the year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat these monsters to obtain unique materials, which can then be exchanged for exclusive outfits, equipment, and interior items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Monster Data Sets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Adds new missions, monsters, and materials to the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Materials from Monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special monsters that appear during gathering or dungeon exploration will drop rare materials.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bread Eggs, Large Ruby, Large Sapphire, Cactie  Seedling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exchangeable Interior Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Flower Land in Yano Market. Requires special materials.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cactie Shelf, Cactie Basket, Macram\u00e9 Cactie, Pair of Macram\u00e9 Cactie, Triple Cactie, Group-planted Cactie, Basket of Cactie, Potted Cactie, Mantel Gold Ingot, Mantel Mineral Domes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exchangeable Outfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St. Requires special materials.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Light Armor, Soft Kid's Panda, Panda Baby Suit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exchangeable Equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St. Requires special materials.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Mask, Golden Wings, Star Bread-style Backpack, Gazo Bread-style Backpack, Veras Bread Hat, River Octo Bread Hat, Shishin Bread-style Canteen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","develope